pplied data.\n\nFrozen captured-delivery replay scope: {\"entrypoint\": \"object-documented\", \"environment\": \"complete stopped delivery; no automatic repair\", \"max_get_gb\": 5.0, \"maximum_attempts\": 1, \"outputs\": \"explicit documented generated files; protect supplied inputs\", \"remove_shipped_outputs\": true, \"rtol\": 1e-06, \"scope\": \"inspection-retrieval-conditional-complete-delivery-replay\", \"source\": \"original-complete-delivery\", \"timeout_seconds\": 7200, \"unsupported_capture_replay\": \"not-checked; never substitute HEAD\"}\nUse fresh-rerun --path \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_TARGET\" --entry from the original documentation with explicit --outputs for generated files and --workdir/--output under STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT. One attempt copies the complete stopped delivery, removes only selected outputs, and uses the documented entrypoint without repair. Unsupported external pointers or unsafe output selection are not-checked; never substitute a Git-only clone or infer scientific failure.\n\nWorker-stop evidence: /Users/johnlee/.local/state/stamped-in-practice/narps-neutral-v1/runs/narps-neutral-r1-08/judgments/narps-neutral-r1-08-j02/attempt-01/worker-end-state.json (SHA-256 77c8a710004eeb6bc42610e3a53bb6905ac963c8746604860256cf30491dde98).\nAssess the scientific artifact contents normally. Grade the worker's versioning, tracking and publication practices at the recorded worker stop. Attribute later coordinator commits, annex conversion, publication and retention separately; those actions do not establish worker compliance. The submitted artifacts must match the recorded stop inventory.\n","text_elements":[]}]},"started_at_ms":1792137881710,"completed_at_ms":1792137881710}}
