{"timestamp":"2026-10-16T08:07:57.536Z","ordinal":164,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a143bd-e0b9-7cb0-beae-fa3ef0e354e7","turn_id":"01a143bd-e0dd-7011-84aa-8156451e509d","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_04ddb3bdd8ce7ace016ad1db5c1ad08192bec62c0c14ed50a6","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The scientific evidence is inspectable and internally coherent: all 54 supplied effects were included, geometry and coverage were checked, the one-sided whole-brain max-T sign-flip test was applied, and the vmPFC proxy estimate is near zero with a confidence interval spanning both signs. I’m recording this as support for the report’s appropriately limited conclusion (“no positive vmPFC support”), while retaining the hypothesis outcome as not supported."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1792138076149,"completed_at_ms":1792138077536}}
