{"timestamp":"2026-10-16T08:08:14.195Z","ordinal":168,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_04ddb3bdd8ce7ace016ad1db5da06c8192870d7216bc5b4d56","status":"completed","call_id":"call_edd4adcc63bb46d18a912806dd3d33e3","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"cat > \\\"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/set-responses.py\\\" <<'PY'\\nimport os, subprocess, pathlib, json\\nrunner=os.environ['STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_RUNNER']; py=os.environ['STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_PYTHON']; out=pathlib.Path(os.environ['STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT']); response=out/'2026-10-16-response.json'\\nitems=[\\n('must/001','met','Workspace root contains input, code, results and figures; supplied map links resolve within it.','judgement',['input/','analysis.py','results/','figures/'],[]),\\n('must/002','met','All 54 gain maps and participant metadata are included under input/; no external dataset route is needed.','probe:subdatasets-resolvable+judgement',['input/data/=54 in-boundary annex payloads','input/participants.tsv=cohort metadata','input/sources.json=source identities'],['probe-overridden']),\\n('must/003','unmet','analysis.py imports external Python packages, but no delivered environment spec or linked software module includes them.','judgement',['analysis.py=imports numpy, pandas, nibabel, nilearn, scipy, matplotlib','delivery inventory=complete; no environment spec'],[]),\\n('must/004','partial','Git is used, but analysis.py, REPORT.md, figures/ and results/ were untracked at worker stop.','probe:tree-clean',['probe:tree-clean=4 untracked deliverable paths','worker-end-state.json=stop inventory includes these paths'],[]),\\n('must/005','met','The 54 participant maps are git-annex pointers with in-boundary payloads; map identities match the stop receipt.','probe:large-in-annex+judgement',['input/data/=54 annex map pointers','worker-end-state.json=payload identities; 0 map payload mismatches'],[]),\\n('must/006','unmet','Shipped results have no worker run record linking the analysis action to an exact environment.','probe:run-env-linked+judgement',['analysis.py=workflow','results/summary.json=shipped result','delivery inventory=complete; no worker run/environment record'],['probe-overridden']),\\n('must/007','unmet','REPORT.md names the script and says to use a supplied Python environment, but gives no install or executable usage instructions.','probe:entry-point+judgement',['REPORT.md#Reproducibility files=script and vague environment note','delivery inventory=complete; no README or Makefile'],['probe-overridden']),\\n('must/008','met','REPORT.md identifies analysis.py as the complete group workflow; the script is a usable starting point.','probe:entry-point+judgement',['REPORT.md#Reproducibility files=analysis.py identified','analysis.py=complete group workflow'],['probe-overridden']),\\n('must/009','met','The workflow builds input and output paths relative to its own location.','probe:no-abs-paths',['analysis.py=ROOT uses Path(__file__).resolve().parent','probe:no-abs-paths=0 host-specific hits'],[]),\\n('must/010','unmet','Required Python packages are imported by analysis.py, but no environment specification declares them.','probe:env-spec-tracked+judgement',['analysis.py=external imports','delivery inventory=complete; specs absent'],[]),\\n('must/011','unmet','The route assumes a supplied Python environment, but the delivery documents no OS, Python stack or host prerequisites.','probe:platform-assumptions+judgement',['REPORT.md#Reproducibility files=assumes supplied environment','delivery inventory=complete; no environment/system requirements'],[]),\\n('must/012','unmet','No clear system requirements or dependency list is delivered.','probe:platform-assumptions+judgement',['REPORT.md=does not list requirements','analysis.py=external imports'],[]),\\n('must/013','unmet','No environment specification is present in the complete worker delivery.','probe:env-spec-tracked',['delivery inventory=complete; no environment specification'],[]),\\n('must/014','unmet','No environment update process is documented, and no environment specification is present.','judgement',['delivery inventory=complete; no environment spec or update procedure'],[]),\\n('must/015','unmet','No frozen environment specification identifies the packages used for the shipped results.','probe:run-env-linked+judgement',['delivery inventory=complete; no lock, container digest or captured environment','results/summary.json=no environment identity'],[]),\\n('must/016','unmet','No worker-declared route publishes an environment specification; the captured Git config has no remote.','probe:env-spec-tracked+judgement',['.git/config=no remote section','REPORT.md=no publication route','delivery inventory=no environment spec'],[]),\\n('must/017','unmet','The report refers to a supplied Python environment, but does not say how to obtain or reconstruct it.','judgement',['REPORT.md#Reproducibility files=environment acquisition unspecified','delivery inventory=complete; no environment spec'],[]),\\n('should/001','met','One Git repository tracks code, inputs and configuration; git-annex stores the large map payloads.','judgement',['.git/config=Git repository with annex filter','input/data/=annex-backed maps'],[]),\\n('should/002','not-checked','No repeated-test history or schedule is recorded; such records would establish regular workflow testing.','probe:ci-present+judgement',['probe:ci-present=no recognized CI; equivalent testing records not located'],[]),\\n('should/003','partial','Inputs and generated outputs have separate directories, but code is at root and no environment module exists.','probe:modules-separated',['input/, results/, figures/, analysis.py=partial separation'],[]),\\n('should/004','not-checked','No fresh-environment run was attempted because the worker supplied no reconstructible environment; a clean run record would settle this.','judgement',['replay record=not checked; missing worker environment specification'],[]),\\n('should/005','unmet','analysis.py runs in the active Python environment and does not create a disposable environment per execution.','judgement',['analysis.py=direct imports and execution; no environment creation'],[]),\\n('should/006','unmet','No exact environment specification exists to reconstitute and test against the shipped results.','judgement',['delivery inventory=complete; no environment spec or reconstitution record'],[]),\\n('should/007','unmet','No environment image, binaries or archived environment artifacts are included.','judgement',['delivery inventory=complete; no environment artifacts'],[]),\\n('should/008','unmet','No environment update process is documented; this duplicates must/014.','judgement',['delivery inventory=complete; no environment spec or update procedure'],['upstream-duplicate']),\\n('should/009','not-applicable','N/A: the supplied anonymized NARPS derivatives and software have no identified restricted component.','judgement',['input/sources.json=public-source provenance','input/participants.tsv=cohort table'],[]),\\n('may/001','not-applicable','N/A: there are no independently maintained project modules; package dependencies are not project modules.','probe:subdatasets-resolvable+judgement',['.git/config=no submodule or remote declaration','analysis.py=ordinary Python package dependencies'],['probe-overridden']),\\n('may/002','partial','REPORT.md identifies the input, workflow, result maps and figures, but does not document their modular composition.','judgement',['REPORT.md#Reproducibility files=artifact roles listed','workspace layout=input, analysis.py, results, figures'],[]),\\n('may/003','partial','Inputs, code and outputs are separated by path, but the workflow has no environment boundary or documented component interface.','judgement',['analysis.py=hard-coded expected input filenames and output dirs','workspace layout=partial path separation'],[]),\\n('may/004','not-applicable','N/A: the object has no independently composed modules.','judgement',['workspace inventory=no independently maintained modules'],[]),\\n('may/005','met','REPORT.md explains the main script and enumerates the result and figure files for navigation.','judgement',['REPORT.md#Reproducibility files=artifact guide'],[]),\\n]\\nfor i,(item,status,reason,source,evidences,flags) in enumerate(items):\\n args=[py,runner,'response','set',str(response),'--item',item,'--status',status,'--reason',reason,'--source',source]\\n for ev in evidences: args += ['--evidence',ev]\\n for flag in flags: args += ['--flag',flag]\\n p=subprocess.run(args,text=True,capture_output=True)\\n (out/'commands'/f'response-set-{i+1:02d}.stdout').write_text(p.stdout)\\n (out/'commands'/f'response-set-{i+1:02d}.stderr').write_text(p.stderr)\\n (out/'commands'/f'response-set-{i+1:02d}.exit').write_text(str(p.returncode)+'\\\\n')\\n if p.returncode: raise SystemExit(f'{item}: {p.returncode}: {p.stderr}')\\nprint(f'updated {len(items)} checklist items')\\nPY\\npython3 \\\"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/set-responses.py\\\" > \\\"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/response-sets.stdout\\\" 2> \\\"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/response-sets.stderr\\\"; cat \\\"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/response-sets.stdout\\\"; cat \\\"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/response-sets.stderr\\\"\",yield_time_ms:30000,max_output_tokens:1000});\ntext(r.output);","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a143bd-e0dd-7011-84aa-8156451e509d","create_time":1792138077.6540458}}}
